  "source_bound": {
    "description": "Without BIG_CALC in the launcher flags, testbench calls direct calc(word & 0xff, word >> 8). It processes the full input array N times, preserving disparity across repetitions, overwrites each output element on each pass, and prints the final pass entries at indices 0,128,... as uppercase %8.8X followed by LF. The bounded profile accepts N up to 160 and keeps the stateful direct-call path and sampled stdout while capping work at 25,600 codeword encodes.",
